[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]
\draw (0,0)--(4.6,0.8);
\draw (4.6,0.8)--(1.9,1.15);
\draw (1.9,1.15)--(1.2,3.2);
\draw (1.2,3.2)--(0,0);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which statement about this quadrilateral is correct?

