[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75]
\draw (0,0)--(5,1.2);
\draw (5,1.2)--(2.3,1);
\draw (2.3,1)--(1.6,3.4);
\draw (1.6,3.4)--(0,0);
\draw[dashed] (0,0)--(2.3,1);
\draw[dashed] (5,1.2)--(1.6,3.4);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
The two diagonals of this quadrilateral have been drawn.
What do they show?

